[ creates "Hello World!" as a file and closes it ]
[ .00000000 ] 00100000 00000000 10000000 0a000000 86000000 [ syscall args setup for first write]
[ .0a000000 ] 8456c6c6 f60275f6 27c64612 [ "Hello World!" string ]
[ .00100000 ] 0e200000 02000000 06000000 [ open the hello world file ]
[ .06100000 ] 02000000 04000000 02000000
[ .0c100000 ] 04300000 02000000 02000000
[ .02200000 ] 08200000 02000000 04000000 [ write c3 into arg1 and 0 into arg2 to exit with 0 ]
[ .08200000 ] c3000000 00000000 00000000 [ syscall number of exit and extra 0 bit to overwrite arg2 ]
[ .0e200000 ] 20000000 0a000000 06000000
[ .04300000 ] 30000000